id: DRAFT-clipman-1.2.0-git20200218.39fd4fe-complete-conan-settings-pass-l0p-gate
trigger_tool: conan
phase: validating
error_signature: \[fail\] L0p: settings缺少compiler/build_type|missing_setting_compiler|missing_setting_build_type
severity: 3
category: build-system, testing, ohos
match_keywords: l0p, missing_setting_compiler, missing_setting_build_type, settings
title: conan配方settings缺compiler/build_type致L0p失败时补齐四项过门禁
root_cause: ci/conan/build_and_test.sh L0p要求settings行同时包含os/compiler/build_type/arch四项，clipman配方只声明了os/arch两项
affected_scope: CI报L0 gate missing_setting_compiler/missing_setting_build_type且配方settings行缺项的conan配方，跨库可复用
affected_scope: CI报L0 gate missing_setting_compiler/missing_setting_build_type且配方settings行缺项的conan配方，跨库可复用
verification_cmd: CI conan-build-test步骤L0p通过且真机预检全部通过，原v2:unknown:unclassified_failure消失
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: complete-settings-to-four-items
rec_description: 将conanfile.py的settings由os/arch两项补齐为os/compiler/build_type/arch四项以满足L0p与profile兼容，新增compiler/build_type不被Go构建逻辑消费，不改变编译行为
rec_command: archives/c/clipman/1.2.0-git20200218.39fd4fe/conanfile.py: settings由os/arch改为os, compiler, build_type, arch
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: profile-compatibility-check
fallback_description: 若profile无法提供compiler/build_type，先核对profile模板与build_and_test.sh约917行L0p检查逻辑的兼容性，确认后再补齐
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: settings\s*=\s*"os",\s*"arch"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止保留缺项的两项settings声明放行，L0p要求四项齐全
forbid_1_consequence: CI L0p报missing_setting_compiler/missing_setting_build_type失败，任务退回修复循环
